21 0 obj
<< /A 339 0 R /Alt (Combined effects of GLP-1RAs and exercise on weight and muscle health. GLP-1Ras promote significant weight loss and cardiometabolic benefits but may reduce skeletal muscle integrity. Exercise supports muscle maintenance and function, though its impact on weight is modest. A combined approach may maximize weight reduction while preserving lean mass.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 17 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
